Main Objective

Learn two-dimensional layouts using CSS Grid.

What You Will Implement

Make three small pages:

-> gallery.html: a photo gallery with at least 9 images using display: grid.
-> product-grid.html: a grid that reflows automatically using repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)).
-> dashboard.html: a dashboard layout (header, sidebar, main, footer) using named grid areas (grid-template-areas).

Use: grid-template-columns, gap, grid-area, fr units.
